00:04:05.040 --> 00:04:11.760
And today we're going to talk
about how Jelly Button have

00:04:11.760 --> 00:04:18.779
replaced their event analytics
pipeline based on the solution

00:04:18.779 --> 00:04:21.610
that I'm going to
